## What We Are Building

**Prod Assistant (PA)** — conversational agent in SandyStudio webapp's right-side panel. Lets Director drive the AI animation production pipeline by voice/text instead of clicking buttons. Implements **Mode 2.5 (Apprentice / Supervised Operator)** from `specs/company/governance.md §4`: agent leads pipeline, Director critiques verbally.

**Strategic plan:** `~/.claude/plans/valiant-soaring-karp.md` — root-cause analysis (RC1-RC6) + Phase A (tactical) + Phase B (Skill Editor / Learning Loop, deferred).

The session spanned 3 phases:
1. **Phase 1-A** (2026-05-08): Rename Concierge → Prod Assistant, modular prompt builder, threads memory, TTS, voice input
2. **Phase 1-B** (2026-05-09 to 2026-05-11 morning): 13 OpenAI function-calling tools, verbal approval gating, behavior protocol
3. **Phase A** (2026-05-11 to 2026-05-12 morning): Root-cause analysis after PA exhibited 7 failure modes during Bible enrichment smoke. Prompt restructuring + ACTIVE_INTENT block + drift logging + gpt-5.5 model swap + reasoning_effort calibration.

