---

## What Did NOT Work (and why)

- **gpt-5.4-mini with verbose behavioral rules** — failed because: model has limited attention budget; later "DO NOT" rules in TOOLS_AVAILABLE block (50+ lines accumulated) dilute earlier rules. PA continued to use banned "если хочешь" phrases despite being explicitly forbidden 4 times.
- **gpt-5.5 with `reasoning_effort=low`** — failed because: model spent all 2000 `max_completion_tokens` on invisible `reasoning_tokens` (2500 reasoning_tokens consumed, 0 chars output, finish_reason=length). PA appeared to "hang" for 50+ seconds, then returned short announcements instead of content.
- **`reasoning_effort=minimal`** on gpt-5.5 — failed because: 400 error "Unsupported value: 'reasoning_effort' does not support 'minimal' with this model. Supported: none, low, medium, high, xhigh".
- **`gpt-5.4-mini` for Bible textual reasoning** — failed because: model confused Bible section types (wrote text content into image-based Library sections via `setBibleContent(section='style')` instead of appending to `general_idea`), causing Director to lose work.
- **JS regex `\b` for Cyrillic verbal approval detection** — failed because: `\b` matches `[A-Za-z0-9_]` only in default mode; "одобряю" never matched. Director said "одобряю" 4 times before tools fired (gate rejected). Fix: token-based scan with Unicode-aware split.
- **`setBibleContent` always POST'ing new version** — failed because: each iteration created v01, v02, v03, v04 DRAFTs. Director: "не плодить новые драфты". Fix: lookup latest version + PUT `/api/assets/[id]/content` for DRAFT/REVIEW/REVISION; POST new version only when previous is LOCKED.
- **`!fb` semantics misunderstood by PA** — failed because: PA said "отправил инженеру" after a `!fb` marker (which is LOG-ONLY, no tool call). Director thought Bible was updated when nothing happened. Fix: system prompt forbids phrasing implying action; PA now says "записал в лог, никаких действий в системе".
- **`break-on-neutral` in approval-check** — failed because: Director said "одобряю", then asked a clarifying question; verbal-approval check stopped at the question (neutral) and refused mutating tools. Fix: scan full window of 4 director turns, take latest approval if no rejection between.
- **PA on long thread learning the asking-pattern from context** — partial failure: after 20+ turns of "ask → approve → ask again" the model amplifies its own asking habit despite system prompt updates. Fresh thread restart resets this.

---

## What Has NOT Been Tried Yet

- **A1b — Responses API migration** for gpt-5.5 (`/v1/responses` instead of `/v1/chat/completions`). Not needed since `reasoning_effort=none` fixes the burn problem, but if Responses API supports better streaming with reasoning models it might be worth trying.
- **Phase B / Path A — Skill Editor / Learning Loop**: full implementation per `valiant-soaring-karp.md` "Phase B" section. Migration `0026_skill_rules.sql`, UI `/skill-editor` page, rule_proposal flow, ACTIVE_RULES injection. ~3-5 days work. Director directive 2026-05-11 #3: "ГРАМОТНУЮ систему" самообучения.
- **Phase B / B1 — Inter-session summaries**: `concierge_summaries` table, auto-generate at thread close (cheap LLM call), inject as `[CONTEXT_FROM_PRIOR_SESSIONS]` block. Director directive 2026-05-11 #2.
- **Phase B / B3 — PA introspection layer**: every Nth turn, PA does self-eval ("did I ask permission for read-only? Score 1-10"). Cheap gpt-5.4-mini call. Score < 5 → activity_event + self-correction.
- **Phase C — Metrics dashboard**: `permission_asks_per_thread`, `verbal_approval_friction`, `tool_calls_per_director_turn`, drift rate. Auto-alert when threshold exceeded.
- **Migration to Anthropic Claude Sonnet 4.6**: Director observed I (Claude in Claude Code) behave better than PA (OpenAI). Architectural hypothesis: same model family in PA would inherit my action-orientation. ~4-6h refactor of `chat/route.ts` from OpenAI SDK to Anthropic SDK. Deferred since gpt-5.5+reasoning=none unblocked progress.
- **PA `setBibleContent` end-to-end retry** with new env — Director was about to test "запиши прямо сейчас" with new config but pivoted to copy-paste workaround (PA generated markdown in chat, Director will paste manually).

